.TH MDV 1 "July 2026" "mdv 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mdv \- full-screen terminal Markdown viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mdv
[\fIflags\fR] \fIfile.md\fR
.br
.I command
|
.B mdv
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mdv
renders CommonMark + GFM Markdown full-screen in the terminal: syntax-highlighted
code, box-drawing tables, incremental search, a fuzzy table-of-contents jump,
link following with vimium-style hints and a jumplist, images (half-block mosaic
anywhere, kitty graphics in kitty/ghostty), LaTeX display math, live reload on
file change, and external editing at the current line.
.PP
When standard output is not a terminal, the rendered document is written as
plain text instead.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-theme " name"
.BR default ,
.BR plain ,
or a path to a YAML theme file whose keys overlay the default theme.
.TP
.BI \-width " n"
Maximum content width in columns (default: terminal width, capped at 120).
.TP
.B \-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B j/k, d/u, space/b, g/G
Scroll: line, half page, page, top/bottom. The mouse wheel works too.
.TP
.B /
Incremental search (smart-case; enter keeps, esc cancels), then
.B n/N
between matches.
.TP
.B t
Table of contents; type to fuzzy-filter, enter jumps.
.TP
.B f
Link hints: type the overlaid label to follow. Clicking a link follows it as
well. Anchors and relative .md links open in mdv; everything else opens via
.BR xdg-open (1).
.TP
.B ctrl+o / tab
Jumplist back / forward, across documents.
.TP
.B e, i
Suspend and edit the file at the current line with \fB$EDITOR\fR (default vim).
.TP
.B y
Copy the nearest code block to the clipboard (OSC 52).
.TP
.B ?, q
Help overlay; quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.MDView/config.yaml
Viewer settings (theme, width, editor, images). Created with a commented
template on first run; command-line flags take precedence.
.TP
.I ~/.MDView/theme.yaml
User theme, overlaying the built-in adaptive theme key by key. Created as
a commented template on first run.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B EDITOR
Editor for the e/i binding (overridden by \fIconfig.yaml\fR's editor key).
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disables styling.
.TP
.B XDG_STATE_HOME
Reading positions persist under \fI$XDG_STATE_HOME/mdv/positions.json\fR
(default \fI~/.local/state/mdv/\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR glow (1),
.BR less (1)
